d error of developing it on my own. Answering the questions also gave me a chance to think more deeply about the ideas behind the game. If you're curious about how DashBreaker came to be, I hope you'll give it a read. Read the full interview (English)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T23:31:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040888","verified_at":"2026-10-25T05:08:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4878220-1846651706692384","game_id":"steam-4878220","kind":"update","title":"DashBreaker Update - Upgrade Tree Rework","summary":"Hello from the developer of DashBreaker! This update introduces a reworked upgrade tree for the demo. The upgrades you buy now open up your next choices, letting you discover new upgrades and abilities as you grow stronger. Upgrade layouts, prices and prerequisites have also been adjusted. The aim is to make the progression from piercing larger enemies to unlocking abilities that change how you fight feel more natural. Returning players: please visit the upgrade terminal before your next sortie.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:17:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692384","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4878220-1846651706682800","game_id":"steam-4878220","kind":"update","title":"DashBreaker Update - More Freedom to Move","summary":"Hello from the developer of DashBreaker! This update is about spending less time saving your dashes and more time moving and crashing into targets. The loop of fighting, collecting resources and permanently upgrading your ship continues. More freedom to move Dashing and using your booster no longer consume extra energy. Dashes still need to recharge, but you have less reason to hold back just to save fuel. Health and fuel have been combined into a single energy pool. Energy drains over time and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T18:53:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682800","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4878220-1846018067936253","game_id":"steam-4878220","kind":"announcement","title":"DashBreaker Renewed — A New Look and a New Way to Play","summary":"Hello from the developer of DashBreaker! DashBreaker has evolved from arcade action into an active incremental game. This renewal brings a full overhaul of the game's progression and visuals. Reworked gameplay — Hands-on dash action now leads into resource collection and permanent upgrades. Revamped visuals — Ships, enemies, UI and combat effects have all received a fresh look. Reworked content and audio — Regions, enemies and upgrades have been reorganized, and the audio has been improved. A no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T13:18:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936253","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4878220-1844751498218117","game_id":"steam-4878220","kind":"update","title":"DashBreaker Demo Update — Training and Controls Improved","summary":"Thank you for playing the DashBreaker Demo. This update makes training easier to follow when learning the basics, and improves combat module setup and several parts of combat. Training improvements Reduced training target counts and durations, and eased the attack patterns in the Phase Armor trial. During training, fuel is unlimited, incoming damage is reduced, and HP cannot fall below 1. Your ship automatically repairs itself after a short time without taking damage. Added the option to skip th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T11:17:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218117","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4878220-1844115010487715","game_id":"steam-4878220","kind":"announcement","title":"DashBreaker Demo Now Available","summary":"Hello.This is SageLab, the developer of DashBreaker.The free DashBreaker demo is now available on Steam.You can now play the game we have been sharing through videos and screenshots.The demo takes you from the opening training sections through to the Dreadnought battle. Download the Demo We are curious to hear how far you get and which moments stay with you.Share what you enjoyed and what could be better in the comments or on the discussion board.Your feedback will help us refine the full game.T","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T23:29:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010487715","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4878220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4878220":"2026-10-26T14:53:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4878220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:55Z"},"5153910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:56Z"}},"con